### 테스트 토큰 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token/test
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email = test@wordiga.com &
nickname = 테스트유저

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 위시 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contentId": "126128"
}

###

### 위시 등록 - 존재하지 않는 콘텐츠 (404 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contentId": "999999"
}

###

### 위시 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "contentId": "126128"
}

###

### 위시 폴더 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 폴더별 위시 목록 조회 (천안시)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes/%EC%B2%9C%EC%95%88%EC%8B%9C
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 폴더별 위시 목록 조회 (기본 위시리스트)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes/%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8%20%EC%9C%84%EC%8B%9C%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 위시 등록 - 인증 없이 (401 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": "126128"
}
